{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11301230","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11301230","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1130123001:1":{"text":"うん。お父さんは昔よく私を肩に乗せてくれた。肩に乗ると遠くまで見えるよ。","source_cn":"我很想老爹，以前老爹喜欢把我放在肩膀上，我可以看得很远。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9BB77255E1D469E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130123002:1":{"text":"お父さんはいつも忙しくて……アルサお姉ちゃんとソーンお兄ちゃんはよく彼の後を追いかけまわしていた。","source_cn":"老爹总是很忙，，阿尔萨姐姐和索恩哥哥会跟在他身后跑来跑去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D123AC6B8E0E186","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130123003:1":{"text":"でも、私が手を伸ばすと、お父さんはいつも私を肩に乗せてくれたの……","source_cn":"但每次，只要我伸手，老爹就会把我放在他的肩膀上……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC0A071C339588E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:小蛮血凯托":{"text":"ババリアのカイト","source":"小蛮血凯托","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}